          "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003",
          "quote": "銓弟錫字公嘏，幼而警悟，與兄弟受業，至應休散，輒獨留不起，精力不倦，致損右目。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003:m0002",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-nanshi-023-wangfen:p003:m0000"
        }
      ],
      "interpretation_note": "銓為長，與《梁書》稱錫為次子相合。",
